{"speciesId":83,"names":{"fr":"Canarticho","es":"Farfetch’d","en":"Farfetch’d","ja":"カモネギ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"The sprig of green onions it holds is its weapon. It is used much like a metal sword."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"The sprig of green onions it holds is its weapon. It is used much like a metal sword."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Lives where reedy plants grow. They are rarely seen, so it's thought their numbers are decreasing."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If anyone tries to disturb where the essential plant sticks grow, it uses its own stick to thwart them."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"If it eats the plant stick it carries as emer­ gency rations, it runs off in search of a new stick."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"In order to pre­ vent their extinction, more people have made an effort to breed these POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is always seen with a stick from a plant. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON occasionally fights with others over choice sticks."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It always walks about with a plant stalk clamped in its beak. The stalk is used for building its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If anyone tries to disturb where the essential plant stalks grow, it uses its own stalk to thwart them."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it eats the plant stalk it carries as emergency rations, it runs off in search of a new stalk."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il ne peut pas vivre sans son légume, c’est pourquoi il le protégera au péril de sa vie."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il ne peut pas vivre sans son légume, c’est pourquoi il le protégera au péril de sa vie."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il utilise le légume qu’il tient comme s’il s’agissait d’une épée."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El puerro que lleva es su mejor arma. Suele usarlo como espada para cortar cosas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"持っている 茎は 大切な 武器でもあり 刀を 振るように いろんな ものを 切ることができる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ce Pokémon se promène toujours en tenant un légume. Il l’utilise pour faire son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Siempre lleva un puerro consigo, con el que construye su nido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It always walks about with a plant stalk clamped in its beak. The stalk is used for building its nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"自分の 巣を 作るための 植物の 茎を １本 いつも 持って 歩いている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On voit souvent des Canarticho avec une tige, récupérée sur une plante quelconque. Apparemment, ils peuvent distinguer les bonnes des mauvaises. On a vu ces Pokémon se battre pour des histoires de tiges."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al parecer, entre los puerros que suelen llevar los Farfetch’d, los hay mejores y peores. A estos Pokémon se les ha visto luchar entre ellos por los mejores puerros."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Farfetch’d is always seen with a stalk from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good stalks and bad stalks. This Pokémon has been known to fight with others over stalks."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"持っている 植物の クキにも 良いものと そうでない ものが あるらしく カモネギ同士が クキを 巡って 戦う ことが ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On voit souvent des Canarticho avec une tige, récupérée sur une plante quelconque. Apparemment, ils peuvent distinguer les bonnes des mauvaises. On a vu ces Pokémon se battre pour des histoires de tiges."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al parecer, entre los puerros que suelen llevar los Farfetch’d, los hay mejores y peores. A estos Pokémon se les ha visto luchar entre ellos por los mejores puerros."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Farfetch’d is always seen with a stalk from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good stalks and bad stalks. This Pokémon has been known to fight with others over stalks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"持っている 植物の クキにも 良いものと そうでない ものが あるらしく カモネギ同士が クキを 巡って 戦う ことが ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Il vit là où poussent des tiges. Ces endroits sont rares, ce qui pourrait faire penser que cette espèce de Pokémon est en voie d’extinction."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Vive cerca de cultivos de puerros. Como estos son cada vez más escasos, se cree que el número de Farfetch’d también ha disminuido."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"They live where reedy plants grow. Farfetch’d are rarely seen, so it’s thought their numbers are decreasing."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"クキが 生えている ところに 住む。 珍しく 数も 少ないので カモネギも 減ってきた らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Il vit là où poussent des tiges. Ces endroits sont rares, ce qui pourrait faire penser que cette espèce de Pokémon est en voie d’extinction."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Vive cerca de cultivos de puerros. Como estos son cada vez más escasos, se cree que el número de Farfetch’d también ha disminuido."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"They live where reedy plants grow. Farfetch’d are rarely seen, so it’s thought their numbers are decreasing."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"クキが 生えている ところに 住む。 珍しく 数も 少ないので カモネギも 減ってきた らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il tranche ses adversaires avec sa tige, qu’il manie comme une épée. Quand la situation l’exige, il s’en nourrit."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Blande el puerro que sujeta con un ala como si se tratase de una espada para rebanar a su rival. En caso de necesidad, se lo come para nutrirse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The stalk this Pokémon carries in its wings serves as a sword to cut down opponents. In a dire situation, the stalk can also serve as food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"羽で もつ 茎を 刀のように 操り 敵を 切り捨てる。 いざと いうときは エサに する。"},{"langu